# MS-V licensing (dual structure)

This repository uses a **two-tier** license model so the concept stays open while
**defense primes and pyrotechnic partners** can team under clear commercial terms.

| Tier | Document | Who |
|------|----------|-----|
| **Public** | MIT below | Anyone — read, fork, study, improve the open concept |
| **Prime / Program** | [LICENSE-COMMERCIAL.md](LICENSE-COMMERCIAL.md) | U.S. primes, fill vendors, and integrators under a signed Prime Collaboration Agreement |

**Partnership guide:** [docs/licensing-and-partnership.md](docs/licensing-and-partnership.md)  
**Inquiry:** [Partnership issue template](https://github.com/Fratres-X-AI/MS-V/issues/new?template=partnership_inquiry.yml)

