## MS-V program notice

This repository contains the **MS-V Veil (Multispectral Obscurant Grenade)** open
concept — documentation, Monte Carlo models, structured data, and concept art for a
**TRL 2 sensitivity study** (140M samples, literature-parameter bounds).

- All specifications, performance figures, MoE percentages, and cloud physics outputs
  are **model-supported and notional** unless and until validated by bench or range test.
- Content is **not** authorization to procure, manufacture, export, field, or employ
  any munition or obscurant system.
- Concept art and diagrams are **illustrative** design references, not build drawings,
  AMCCOM-approved marking packages, or technical data packages.
- Inventory grenade names (AN-M8, M83, M201A1) are cited for trade-study context only;
  no endorsement is implied.

For prime teaming, fill characterization, or production licensing, use the partnership
guide and inquiry links above — not an informal email without a PCA.
